---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy | López Márquez Abogados" description="Privacy information for the López Márquez Abogados website and contact channels." noindex={true}>
<PageHero eyebrow="Legal information" title="Privacy Policy" description="How personal data is handled when you use this website or contact the firm." />
<section class="section"><div class="container prose"><h2>Website enquiries</h2><p>The contact form sends the minimum information needed to handle the enquiry and creates an internal record of the request. The final privacy notice must identify the providers used for that flow and the applicable retention period.</p><h2>What not to send at first contact</h2><p>Do not send passwords, bank details, passport/NIE information or medical records unless the firm expressly asks for them through an appropriate channel.</p><div class="notice">Launch gate: validate the final controller details, legal basis, providers and retention periods before production.</div></div></section>
</Layout>
